Relationship Notes

SO-F-005 is formally subordinate to SO-F-001 while operationally following SO-F-004.

Its immediate input is an approved decision produced through an authorization process that has not yet been architecturally assigned.

Its primary output is vehicle action accompanied by relevant execution-state information.

Neither authorization ownership nor feedback ownership shall be inferred from this document.
